  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Relay Fleet Health \u2014 Grafana mirror of `ops/relay/health/`\nRenders the **same signals** the custom single-file dashboard shows, by consuming the prober's own output via the node-exporter **textfile collector** (`relay-health-to-prom.py` \u2192 `goat_relay_*`). This is how Grafana reaches near-parity: it reuses the prober's STUN / enroll-ratio / deep metrics rather than re-deriving them with blackbox (which cannot do STUN or the enroll-SNI handshake). Honesty: a stale `.prom` greys via `goat_relay_probe_timestamp_seconds` age; rates show `\u2014` until two samples."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Relays OK",
      "description": "rathole-control-up count (tunnel-endpoint vantage)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
